WEBVTT

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.490
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.070
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.410
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.950
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.830
Get my words, take my rights!

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.210
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:28.330
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.670
Get my words, take my rights!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.130
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.630
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.920
has something managed to change?

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.800
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.810
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:49.690
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:52.360
It's a problem everyone faces

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.820
unable to even sleep at night!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.030
C'mon and Break down!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.660
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.450
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:10.000
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.380
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:20.180
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.010
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.700
I admire Handa Sei...

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.700
No, I used to admire him.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.820
To admire is to like.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.620
It means you can merely think of that person.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.580
It means you can never be one with that person.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.420
Must be my imagination...

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.880
That's not enough...

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.590
I can't admire him forever.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.550
I was born to be Handa Sei.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.760
No, I am Handa Sei!

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.140
<b>Hustle so that you
can emit a smile
like sunbeams
Handa Sei</b>

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:04.980
Ta-da!

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.270
Check it out! Neat, right?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:06.520
Handa-kun's work?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.890
<i>"Handa-kun and Handa-kun?"
Handa-kun's work?</i>

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:11.980
My sis said she got this from
a street artist at Oohiroi Park.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:15.740
So, that rumor about him writing poems
and verses on the street after school was true.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.150
Let's go and check him out today!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:17.530
Yup!

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.820
Let's, let's!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.330
I've been made into a street poet
without my knowing...

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.870
I don't remember any such thing...
I haven't written a single poem in my life.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.330
<b>Hustle so that you
can emit a smile
like sunbeams
Handa Sei</b>

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.500
Let's make this our class slogan!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:29.460
Nice!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.420
Why is this happening to me?!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.130
Don't attribute my name to that crappy poem!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.670
What do you think about that?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.260
Would Handa write poems?

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.550
Why do they have to come near me?

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:45.720
As far as I know, Handa-kun
would never try to stand out.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.600
He goes straight home after
school to do his work... I think...

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.060
He would only stop at the
art supply store... I think...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.440
He doesn't have the time to be
hanging out at the park... I think...

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.150
Huh... You all sure know a lot...

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.320
Because I've been following him...

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.120
That said...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.080
I doubt there's any chance
that he's the one there, but...

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.950
Let's go and find out.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.370
Right?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.670
Why me too...?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.630
There goes another day without
a single complaint from me.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.760
Knowing someone is out there using
my name to make crappy poems,

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:27.100
and being made fun of by everyone
in class over it, is irritating...

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.520
Hey, Han...

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:28.600
It's time for me to retaliate.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.390
...da?
It's time for me to retaliate.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:29.680
It's time for me to retaliate.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.020
I need to relay my anger...

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.520
Hey, Handa...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.820
Is this where we have to wait for Handa-san?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.860
Hey, isn't that Handa?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.490
Let me write
your very own verse
Handa's World
He was in class a short while ago!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.700
Let me write
your very own verse

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.920
Stop it!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.420
You shouldn't punch
someone on sight like that!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.380
I'm sorry...

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.460
It just got to me, like finding
pineapple in sweet and sour pork...

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:02.050
You wouldn't punch a pineapple, would you?!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.640
Hey, are you all right?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.550
That hurt...

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:09.640
You're not going to get away with
doing this to a calligrapher like me.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.850
Like I said, stop hitting him!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.690
So, it looks like it was
just a Handa-san impostor.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.490
You were using Handa's name to make money?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.620
Don't think I'm some kind of fake
looking to make chump change...

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.790
I was born to be the true Handa—

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:31.120
Your mouth...! Cover your mouth!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.330
It's messing with my head how
much you look like the real Handa!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.290
I am the true Handa Sei
born from Handa himself!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:41.590
Just kidding! I'm Hanada Kei.
My name's similar too, right?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.260
I've been a fan of Handa's from the moment
I saw him at the high-school entrance ceremony.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.220
I'm just an overly inspired faker!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.390
So please, not the hair!
It took me two hours to set it!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:56.100
So, you're a Handa-kun admirer whose
hobby is cosplaying as Handa-kun?

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:56.980
Yes...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:02.940
I became so attached to him that
I started to think I was the real Handa...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.860
You're more a freak than
someone with a hobby.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.910
Well, I can actually relate to him.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.490
I'm always observing Handa,
even when we're in different classes.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.200
Handa walking!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.870
Yeah, that's just like him.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.080
Handa doing calligraphy!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.380
Handa next to a window!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.130
That's so like him.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.710
Handa running into the restroom!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.010
Yes, yes, so accurate.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.430
Not bad at all!

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.010
I wonder if they're aware
that they aren't normal, either...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:28.680
Hey, he really is here!
I wonder if they're aware
that they aren't normal, either...

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:29.390
Hey, he really is here!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.600
Handa Sei-kun!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.810
I didn't think we'd find him so easily.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:39.060
C'mon, just drop the calligraphy
stuff and come with us!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.400
Dang it, the predatory third-year girls...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.360
Predatory?!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.780
That phony is going to be
eaten alive if we leave him alone!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.870
I'm sure they can tell he's a phony.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.370
If those predatory girls don't know Handa
well enough, they may think he's the real deal.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.790
What a pain!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:57.080
Hey, he really is here!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.580
Handa-kun!
Hey, he really is here!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.210
Dang it, more incoming!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.590
Look at how high that phony
is being lifted into the air.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.680
I mimicked Handa so well that none of
the students could tell the difference...

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.640
...but is this what the real
Handa has to go through?!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.310
I can't take this...

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.570
I can't be Handa Sei.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:28.820
Huh?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.740
I thought Handa-kun was around...

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.990
This isn't Handa Sei?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.200
He's just a phony.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.250
C'mon, let's go.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.670
We didn't know why, but...

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.000
...we couldn't hold back our tears.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.050
Handa-kun was assigned to class
duty today, so he could still be there.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.930
Come with us and apologize to him directly.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:56.770
Yes...

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.350
Well, at least be ready to be punched.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.190
I will never abuse Handa Sei's name again.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:06.990
Even if I were reincarnated multiple times,
I could never be Handa-kun.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.780
I will live a peaceful life as
Hanada Kei from now on...

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:21.540
If you're going
to copy someone,
be better at it
Seishu

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.350
Handa-kun...!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.390
What is this?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.270
Ta-da!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.440
I got braces on my teeth!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.020
Huh?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.900
I thought you weren't going to mimic him.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.900
But I'd look like him if my
teeth were aligned, right?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.690
You saw Handa-kun's words...

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.320
I'll get better at being Handa Sei,

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.490
and dedicate my life to being the epitome
of what it means to be Handa Sei!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:57.160
Looks like we have got another
hardcore Handa otaku...

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.210
I thought I knew everything about Handa Sei,
but I actually didn't know a thing about him.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.710
He really is a profound and mysterious person...

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:09.800
Huh?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:10.880
Is that the real Handa-kun?

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.880
You're right! Let's get him!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:23.940
Seriously?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.270
What a scoop!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:32.200
And just like that, the rumor spread about
Hands having a super cute girlfriend...

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.450
Did you hear?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.620
You mean about Handa-kun having a girlfriend?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.500
He's been playing with us!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.710
With the appearance of
Handa's special someone...

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.340
...the Handa fad was about to end,
and the Handa bashing was to begin.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.800
But this didn't change a thing about
Handa's daily outlook on things.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.510
Tsuk-kun, what do you think?

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.510
Who are you calling "Tsuk-kun"?
Don't tack on such a weird nickname.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:01.100
But yeah, looks like the rumor's spreading fast.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:05.600
That doesn't bother me, but it looks
like the girls are really jealous now...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.770
Who wouldn't be?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.400
Not that it could be helped,
with such a beautiful girlfriend.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.530
Wonder if she's older?

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.990
I feel like he's untouchable to us now...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.240
Yeah...

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.490
As far as I know, they haven't
spoken with Handa-kun before...

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.740
Besides that, I'm more concerned
about my parent-child meeting...

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:22.910
You had yours yesterday, right?

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.080
Did you talk about your career path?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.790
Career aside, my mom was in tears
just knowing I was back in school again.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:35.930
Seeing my mom so happy made me realize
again how grateful I am to Handa-san.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.970
But, at this rate, I might have
to repeat my grade again...

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:39.930
Seriously?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.430
Maybe that's why his mom was crying...

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.020
"Die"?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.600
It does say "die."

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.520
I'm used to vandalism,
but today's is pretty overt.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.110
Whatever.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.570
What's with that scribbling?!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:58.700
Damn it, I let down my Handa guard
because of my meeting!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:01.330
Who did that?!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:01.910
Let's get the class started.
Who did that?!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.620
That's a bit extreme...
Let's get the class started.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.660
That's a bit extreme...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.290
Now that I look at it carefully,
it's written really well...

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.710
The stop and swipe of the
stroke is done well, too...

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.540
It's too bad the final stroke is a bit rough, but...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:16.300
If that was intentional, I'd like to
find out the reasoning behind it.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.890
I need to find the person who wrote this...

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.260
Let's go to page 44.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:27.270
Even for a love-hate thing,
this is going a bit too far.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.730
Don't know what girl did this, but if I find her,
she'll savor the Tsutsui-style chop!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.570
No mercy, even for girls?!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.320
Do you notice anything?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:40.070
From the looks of it, I'm sure it's
the work of someone in our class.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:43.370
What bothers me is that it also looks
like it's written to mean "I'll die."

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.700
You're right. I guess you
could interpret it as "I'll die."

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.910
Maybe this is a—

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.420
We've got trouble!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.250
A girl in our class is gonna jump!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.250
What?!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.920
So this scribbling is...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.380
...a suicide note!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:58.760
That's right.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.510
I'll replace my desk with a spare.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.390
Miyo...!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.430
Why?!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.140
Why are you doing this?!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:13.150
Miyo-chan, you're too happy a person
to risk your life like this!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.770
Can you go and bring some mats?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.480
Okay!

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.730
Who is she?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.190
Kinjou Miyoko.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.610
She's the girl who sits next to Handa-kun.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.620
She does well in school, has a lot of friends,
and is highly regarded by teachers too.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.910
Why would she do such a thing?

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:32.880
Her life started taking a turn for the worse
the moment she got the eraser from Handa-kun.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.840
How extensively does he research these things?

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.050
Handa-kun...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:41.130
Handa-kun! Handa-kun! Handa-kun...!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.720
The very day you gave me your eraser...

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.770
...were you dirty even then?!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.600
Hey, she's yelling all of a sudden.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.560
She must be reaching out to Handa-kun.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.190
Watch it!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:53.350
Calm down! Calm down!
Watch it!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.810
It sure is noisy outside.
Calm down! Calm down!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:55.730
Calm down! Calm down!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:01.200
Can you even imagine how much
I've suffered since that day?!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.120
No... There's no way you could...

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.470
A theatrical fanatic...

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.930
I was always looking at Handa-kun.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:13.390
But it wasn't a vulgar love where I would
want to become his lover or confine him!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.190
Vulgar or not, confinement isn't okay...

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.190
Even when I was sitting next to Handa-kun...

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.320
Even when I got the eraser from Handa-kun...

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:24.030
...I kept telling myself that I was
merely one of his many fans.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:27.200
Handa-kun has to belong to everyone!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:31.620
That's why Handa-kun toying
with the lives of us fans...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:35.870
...while nurturing love with another girl
behind our backs can't be forgiven!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.840
I bet you were just laughing at us fans...

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.670
...in you and your lover's secret nest!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.840
I feel sorry for Handa-kun having
to sit next to such a radical...

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.600
I will offer my life in hope that Handa-kun

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.810
will never belong to anyone,
but will continue to belong to everyone.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.100
Kinjou-san, calm down!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.520
Please watch me, Handa-kun...

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.520
You shouldn't belong to someone...

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:05.360
If you ever come to love someone,
please remember what happened today...

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.660
Forever, and ever...

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:11.990
Handa-kun?!

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.950
Why is he here?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.330
That's the desk that I wrote my suicide note on.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.840
Is he trying to tell me
something by bringing it here?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.170
She's looking behind her.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.300
Is someone there?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.970
My resolve is unwavering!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.680
Let's see you try and stop me!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.760
None of these desks seem to work...

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.020
I can't write well if it isn't the right height...

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:35.890
Let's hear it!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.440
I didn't pay attention until now, but...

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:44.030
...you were irreplaceable
and special to me all along.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.400
It was because of me you
had to suffer like this...

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:50.660
I'm sorry.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.800
Looks like she stepped down.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.010
We don't need the mats anymore.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:16.560
There's no way I could curse you after
that kind of apology, Handa-kun...

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:20.140
I'll use you carefully from now on, Desk-san.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.150
Miyo!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.560
Miyo-chan!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:28.030
You're telling me to live in
suffering with my jealousy?

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.490
You're so cruel, yet kind...

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.710
Huh, so Handa strikes again.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.170
I can see why the girls are all over him.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.920
I'm not really understanding what happened...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.840
I know now...

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.090
To love someone is to not
expect something in return.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.310
Wearing yourself down for
the sake of another is true love.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.890
I'll love like an eraser from now on.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:01.890
So...

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.060
...even if Handa-kun has a g-g...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.270
...girlfriend...!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.360
Miyo-chan, get a hold of yourself!
...girlfriend...!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:07.940
Miyo-chan, get a hold of yourself!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.070
I can't take it!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.370
Jealousy sure can change people.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.950
I'm not sure I'll be able to get
along with her in this state.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:24.000
Stupid...! Handa-kun...! Stupid...!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.500
Are you all right?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.920
Ah... Thank yo—

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.380
Are you okay now?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.430
She's Handa-kun's...

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.350
I'm sorry to bother you,
She's Handa-kun's...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:36.550
...g-g-g-girl...
I'm sorry to bother you,

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.350
but can you direct me to the faculty room?
...g-g-g-girl...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.010
but can you direct me to the faculty room?

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:39.970
Huh?

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.730
I came for the parent-child meeting,
but I think I'm lost...

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.020
Um... Are you by any chance Handa-kun's...?

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:48.610
I'm his mother.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.110
Mother was excited, but...

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:54.530
Parent-Child Meeting Notice

00:16:54.530 --> 00:17:00.240
...she will probably have to face the truth
that her son is hated by everyone in school.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.250
It was his mom...

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.630
Huh? What'd you say?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.380
Miyo, you shouldn't have taken
off like that until you erased it.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:13.130
And like that, the Handa Sei bashing ended.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.090
During the parent-childmeeting,
my teacher said...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:20.310
Handa-kun seems to lack a bit of sociability.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.270
My mother said...

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.930
He wasn't like this before...

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:28.650
I said that a school is where you go to study,
so there's no need for me to be sociable.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:32.690
I tried to act tough...
and tried to bring up logic.

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.660
Well, just try to speak a bit more
with your classmates.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.870
Speak a bit more?

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.620
You know, small talk.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.910
Like, "it's such a fine day today."

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:47.250
You could also look for a hobby
or a relatable subject to talk about.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.590
A hobby or a relatable subject...

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:53.380
Mother... Your son is hated in school.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.380
Do your best, Sei-san.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:57.220
<i>"Handa-kun and Sociability"</i>

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:03.810
And so, I've been forced to speak to my
classmates without any real purpose...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:08.400
I guess I'll talk a bit about the weather
with whoever's around me...

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:11.820
Handa-kun... Handa-kun... Handa-kun...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.860
Looks like she really hates me...

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:14.900
Handa-kun... Handa-kun... Handa-kun...

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.360
Speaking with girls is a bit of a hurdle to me!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.620
Handa-kun, there's going to
be a student council meeting,

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.410
He usually only talks about
the student council, but...
and the president of the student council...

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.620
Handa-kun?

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:26.580
Good work.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.460
Huh? What...?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.460
I'm doing this because I want to,
so you didn't have to...

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.420
Shoot... He isn't reacting well...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:35.880
Despite being hated, I still seem to
speak like some kind of superior...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.390
The work I've done as the class rep
has finally been rewarded!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.260
Next, I'll try to be friendly.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.890
Look, look! Ain't I super cute?

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.640
C'mon, Reo. You're acting stupid.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:51.060
I see... Frolicking a bit
makes you look friendlier.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:59.030
Dang it... Handa covered himself
because of the noise we made.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.910
I'm sorry...

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.620
This didn't go well at all...

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.580
C'mon Tsutsui!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.370
The guys at Kuro High are
taking money from our students!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.910
Help us!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.380
Like I said, I'm not fighting anymore.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.840
The truant delinquent...

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.300
I'm only going to use my
fists for the right person.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.340
The right person

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:15.960
I'm only going to use my
fists for the right person.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.460
Delinquents are scary, but...

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.800
...I did speak with him before.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.010
Damn it! Those Kuro High bastards!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.520
Testing... Testing...

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.060
"The weather's nice today,
so can you open the window?"

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.060
Good, this is it.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.900
Did I get on his nerves?

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:36.860
No...

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.530
That's the face of a man who's
going to say something important.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.990
It must be a sign of the
coming battle against Kuro High.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.370
Um...

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.240
Yeah! Tell me what to do!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.460
I'm ready to throw my life away for you!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.000
The weather's nice today...

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.630
Yeah...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.630
The perfect day to strike!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.840
Is that what a nice day means to him?!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.180
But I can't take back what I said now!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.220
W-Window...

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.010
Window?!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.550
What does he mean?

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:11.060
He's probably telling me to show my resolve,
throwing everything away for battle!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.860
My resolve won't fear
even expulsion from school!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.270
The heck are you doing, Tsuk-kun?!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.700
I'm running out of options...

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.950
At this rate, I'm never going
to be able to speak with anyone.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.740
In the first place, why should I speak
with someone when I don't need to?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.000
If only there was a subject I could relate to...

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.710
Huh? Where did everyone go?

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.500
Modern Japanese class is
supposed to be next, but...

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.960
Dang, I wasn't paying attention!
Where am I supposed to go?!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.170
Ah.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.220
It's Handa-kun...

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:42.970
Lucky me!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:46.850
Didn't anyone tell him that we have
to move to a different classroom?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.720
He really is following me...

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.060
I want to give him a
"Thanks for Saving Me" award.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.350
That's right... now is my chance.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.690
Relatable subject... Relatable subject...

00:20:58.940 --> 00:20:59.940
Japan...

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.610
Japan's a nice place, right?

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.450
Huh?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.740
What's with his internationally minded query?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.040
Um... Japan?

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.500
Shoot! That must have been
way too vague of a subject!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:19.630
Anyone would look that way if someone they
weren't friends with asked such a question!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.710
It sure is.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.010
Not that I have anything to compare it to,
since I've never gone overseas.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.600
I knew it!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.690
Japan is a great place after all!

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.480
I knew I could do this!

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.070
I really can't tell what makes Handa-kun click...

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.110
Mother, don't be surprised!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.320
What is it, Sei-san?

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.660
I spoke with a classmate today!

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:52.040
Oh, is that so?

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:54.330
Here, Sei-san. Be careful, it's hot.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:57.580
We spoke a good bit on a
subject we could relate to!

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.420
Oh... That's good.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.090
After seeing his mother's lack of interest...

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:08.640
...Handa thought, "Come to think of it,
this isn't that amazing."

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:25.020
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:31.200
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:37.080
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:42.330
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:46.590
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:50.300
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:54.260
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:58.520
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:06.110
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:11.280
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:18.950
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:22.160
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:26.420
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.520
"Die" is such a blunt piece of slander.

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:59.290
Usually it's like...

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:08.300
Next time, "Handa-kun and the Student Council,"
and "Handa-kun and Memory Loss."

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:09.720
See you again!
